			"type": "text",
			"text": "## 🌐 FastAPI Server\n`server.py`\n\n**Endpoints:**\n- `POST /api/run` (Start Task)\n- `POST /api/upload` (File Ingestion)\n- `SSE /api/run` (Real-time Stream)\n- `Static` (Serve Web Assets)",
